{"ticker":"PEG","updated":"2026-11-14T01:19:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Public Service Enterprise Group Incorporated","shortName":"Public Service Enterprise Group","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://investor.pseg.com","fullTimeEmployees":13189,"marketCap":37827350528,"trailingPE":21.435028,"forwardPE":16.382292,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0661707,"pegRatio":3.5,"targetMeanPrice":81.21053,"targetHighPrice":96.0,"targetLowPrice":69.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.064,"earningsGrowth":-0.391,"grossMargins":0.32115,"operatingMargins":0.22258,"profitMargins":0.14315,"totalRevenue":12337000448,"beta":0.491,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":87.63,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":66.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.58},"summary":"Public Service Enterprise Group Incorporated, through its subsidiaries, operates in electric and gas utility, and nuclear generation businesses in the United States. It operates through PSE&G and PSEG Power segments. The PSE&G segment transmits electricity; distributes electricity and natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers; and appliance services and repairs to customers through its service territory, as well as invests in solar generation projects, and energy efficiency and related programs. The PSEG Power segment engages in nuclear generation businesses; and supplies power and natural gas to nuclear power plants. As of December 31, 2025, it had electric transmission and distribution system of 25,000 circuit miles and 871,000 poles; 58 switching stations with an installed capacity of 40,000 megavolt-amperes (MVA), and 238 substations with an installed capacity of 10,890 MVA; four electric distribution headquarters and five electric sub-headquarters; 18,000 miles of gas mains, 12 gas distribution headquarters, two sub-headquarters, and two meter shop, as well as 54 natural gas metering and regulating stations; and 158 MegaWatts defined conditions of installed PV solar capacity. The company was founded in 1903 and is based in Newark, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"公共服务企业集团公司通过其子公司在美国经营电力和燃气公用事业以及核发电业务。它透過 PSE&G 和 PSEG 電力部門運作。 PSE&G 部分傳輸電力；向住宅、商業和工業客戶分配電力和天然氣；透過其服務範圍向客戶提供家電服務和維修，並投資太陽能發電項目、能源效率及相關計劃。 PSEG电力部门从事核发电业务；并向核电站供应电力和天然气。截至2025年12月31日，輸配電系統里程達25,000英里，桿數871,000根；58座開關站，裝置容量為40,000兆伏安（MVA）；238座變電站，裝置容量為10,890 MVAC； 18,000英里的燃氣總管、12個燃氣分配總部、2個分總部和2個儀表車間，以及54個天然氣計量和調節站；158兆瓦定義了光伏太陽能裝置容量的條件。该公司成立于 1903 年，总部位于新泽西州纽瓦克。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":82.76,"h":83.66,"l":82.75,"c":82.97,"v":2281600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":82.58,"h":82.93,"l":81.13,"c":81.22,"v":1707300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":81.6,"h":81.98,"l":80.22,"c":80.43,"v":3405500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":80.61,"h":81.91,"l":80.15,"c":81.19,"v":2426300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":81.37,"h":81.91,"l":80.82,"c":81.6,"v":4629400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":81.65,"h":82.05,"l":80.69,"c":81.73,"v":2331400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":81.92,"h":82.3,"l":81.45,"c":82.21,"v":1894200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":82.32,"h":82.8,"l":82.09,"c":82.4,"v":2460300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":82.03,"h":82.28,"l":80.78,"c":80.88,"v":2627600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":81.19,"h":82.33,"l":80.96,"c":82.3,"v":2326300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":82.31,"h":83.23,"l":81.51,"c":83.04,"v":2906800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":83.02,"h":83.49,"l":82.6,"c":83.46,"v":2568800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":83.45,"h":83.93,"l":82.46,"c":82.55,"v":2213500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":82.39,"h":82.72,"l":81.13,"c":81.58,"v":3159100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":81.87,"h":82.35,"l":81.52,"c":82.0,"v":3053000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":82.5,"h":82.58,"l":80.12,"c":81.84,"v":3741500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":81.59,"h":82.25,"l":80.16,"c":80.52,"v":3351500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":80.78,"h":82.67,"l":80.25,"c":81.8,"v":3850700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":82.28,"h":82.53,"l":81.09,"c":81.4,"v":2471600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":81.69,"h":82.33,"l":80.19,"c":80.65,"v":2